		{"id":"a9025b046107acfe","x":-290,"y":820,"width":365,"height":260,"type":"text","text":"#### Crossways\nSerpentine shaped Stone atop mound\nTwigs and small bones at base left by animals\nAbandoned creature nest\nNatural stone but brought from a different location"},
