		{"id":"cf455a852330a9ce","x":-560,"y":1260,"width":400,"height":380,"color":"5","type":"text","text":"Moist and shaded area\nlimited light in canyon\nGain in elevation\nDrips of water and puddles off wall\n\nPuddles are moving\n\nSlithering trackers\nLighting storm\n\nBoulder falls upon caenis\nKaulinana tries to burn the crevasse as we pass\n\nFind a desiccated human skeleton that we rebury\nPotable water source? Maybe needs cleaning"},
